# Copy to .env.local (local) or add in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# For local development, `pnpm db:start` prints the Supabase values.

# ---- Public: built into the browser bundle. Safe to expose (RLS protects the data).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# The app's own address; used to build share links (/s/...). No trailing slash.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ---- Server only. Never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Signs images on the public share page, and lets `pnpm seed` create demo data.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# Optional: Takara's WhatsApp number (+971...). Shops waiting for approval get a link to message it.
# TAKARA_WHATSAPP=
# AI fill from photo and "Write with AI". Optional: without it the app works and says AI isn't set up.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides (see DECISIONS.md, sections 10 and 15).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=low
